 "notes": "ALIEN #43, boss card with items: no exit; the three weapons on the back must each be picked up before the matching attack on the alien Lair (front centre). ROUGH MAP: the tentacle lanes cross and branch in ways I could not resolve; most junctions are guesses and need a full human pass in the editor. Doubts: how the start gun panel connects (assumed: lane above it, to the top blob and to door 0.63,0.13); which tentacles of the alien body (lair) reach doors (0.37,0.76), (0.65,0.79), (0.75,0.56), (0.23,0.60); back item bubbles' entrances (orange via doors 0.37,0.33 and 0.33,0.56; red via doors 0.79,0.42 and 0.78,0.75; blue via the lane at (0.25,0.85)).",
